{"query":"RUNWAL DEVELOPERS PVT LTD  official site amenities","follow_up_questions":null,"answer":null,"images":[],"results":[{"url":"https://runwalrealty.com/our-project/residential-ongoing/runwal-the-central-park","title":"Luxury Residential Projects in Pune | Runwal Central Park","content":"payments and other relevant terms independently with the Promoter’s sales team only, by physically visiting the project site and the authorized website of RERA. You are requested NOT to visit any unauthorized or unverified website/broker (online/offline) to receive any information about any projects of the Promoter and/or its sister concerns.The Project presently financed by ICICI Bank Ltd and NOC / permission of ICICI Bank Ltd will be obtained for sale of property, if required. \\ T&C Apply. [...] ### Amenities Beyond the Home\n\nRunwal The Central Park has over 50 amenities spread across landscaped and podium-level space, anchored by one of PCMC’s largest clubhouses at 50,000 sq. ft. Residents get everything from a bonfire deck, barbecue deck and alfresco dining to a yoga and meditation deck, reflexology path, tree houses and a dedicated kids’ play zone. The development also houses the largest indoor pool in PCMC. For those searching for the best apartments in Pune on the basis of lifestyle offerings, this project is worth considering.\n\n### RERA Details [...] +\n\nAmong new ongoing projects in Pune, Runwal The Central Park stands out for combining the city's largest 26-acre scale with international design standards, 50+ wellness amenities, and strategic connectivity in Chinchwad offering a complete lifestyle that goes well beyond a conventional residential development.\n\n### How does Runwal The Central Park stand out among ongoing construction projects in Pune?\n\n+\n\nAmong ongoing projects in Pune, Runwal The Central Park distinguishes itself as the tallest development in PCMC with the largest clubhouse, spanning 26 acres and featuring 40-storey towers, 50+ lifestyle amenities, and extensive green spaces.\n\n### What are the key residential projects by Runwal Realty?\n\n+","score":0.9211838445747762,"raw_content":null,"id":"b9b6e1-00"},{"url":"https://runwalrealty.com/our-project/residential-ongoing/runwal-lands-end","title":"Luxury Residential Projects in Kolshet | Runwal Lands End","content":"payments and other relevant terms independently with the Promoter’s sales team only, by physically visiting the project site and the authorized website of RERA. You are requested NOT to visit any unauthorized or unverified website/broker (online/offline) to receive any information about any projects of the Promoter and/or its sister concerns. The Project presently financed by JM Financial Credit Solution Ltd and NOC / permission of JM Financial Credit Solution Ltd will be obtained for sale of property, if required. \\ T&C Apply. [...] Aromatic Grove\n\nTree-Lined Avenue Walk\n\nLily Pond\n\nFlower Tunnel Circle\n\nRiver Gazing Deck\n\nReflecting Waterbody\n\nSand Beach\n\nShow More Amenities\n\nKids' Play Area\n\nSandpit\n\nAmphitheatre\n\nDance Arena\n\nChess\n\nBarbeque Zone\n\nBanquet Lawn\n\nCraft Wall\n\nViewing Gallery\n\nCocoon Seating/Picnic Corner\n\nCelebration Plaza\n\nSit-Out\n\nSelfie Point\n\nShow More Amenities\n\nZen Garden\n\nReflexology Path\n\nSenior Citizens' Corner\n\nSunshine/Sunrise Gazebo\n\nSwimming Pool\n\nKids' Pool\n\nPutting Golf\n\nMeditation Circle\n\nYoga Zone\n\nPet Trail\n\nJungle Adventure & Gym\n\nRock Climbing Wall\n\nShow More Amenities\n\n## Gallery\n\n## Framing Timeless Design\n\n Renders\n Show Flat\n 360 View\n\nAerial Amenities\n\nAmphi Amphi\n\nBED-ROOM\n\nButterfly Garden\n\nCricket Pitch\n\nElevation Front\n\nFootball\n\nGuest bedroom\n\nImage Gallery\n\nKabana View [...] Explore: Flats in Thane | Ready and New Launch Apartments by Runwal Realty\n\n### Amenities Beyond the Home\n\nThe project’s amenities are laid out across the ground floor and podium level, adding up to 46 listed features. On the ground floor, this includes a rock-climbing wall, a butterfly dome, a tree house, a fruit orchard, a football court, and a banquet lawn. The podium level adds a swimming pool, a beach pool, a tennis court, a cricket ground, an amphitheatre, a senior citizen’s corner, and a sand beach, among others. The clubhouse itself spans approximately 40,000 sq. ft. on the podium level, and the brochure describes it as one of Kolshet’s largest. This is a wide spread of amenities for anyone comparing apartments in Kolshet Thane.\n\n### RERA Details","score":0.9194019325359807,"raw_content":null,"id":"e44f08-01"},{"url":"https://www.facebook.com/RunwalEnterprises/videos/from-breathtaking-skyline-views-and-a-sky-deck-nearly-700-ft-above-ground-to-tho/2190222605136051","title":"From breathtaking skyline views and a sky deck nearly 700 ft above ...","content":"... amenities, every detail at Runwal ... No photo description available. Kolte Patil Developers Ltd. Kolte Patil Develope... 󱢏. Real Estate","score":0.9130014266040223,"raw_content":null,"id":"954a13-02"},{"url":"https://runwalrealty.com","title":"Top Real Estate Developers in Mumbai | Runwal Realty","content":"On the commercial side, R Square in Andheri and Mulund offer IGBC-certified office addresses for modern businesses. The retail portfolio includes R City in Ghatkopar West, 1.2 million sq ft housing 350+ global brands, and R Mall, and R Odeon in Thane West, Mulund and Ghatkopar East. The commitment that has guided every project remains unchanged, building for generations to come.\n\nAll figures sourced from the Runwal Developers Ltd. Draft Red Herring Prospectus filed with SEBI, September 2025.  View DRHP →\n\nRead Less ↑)\n\nRunwal Group Transitions into Two Independent Groups —  \n Runwal Realty and Runwal Enterprises\n\nFrom 2016 onwards, the Group has operated as two distinct entities — Runwal Realty and Runwal Enterprises — each with its own leadership, identity, and strategic direction. [...] Runwal Realty - Crafting Addresses Across Mumbai, Thane & Pune Since 1978\n\nRunwal Realty, the brand of Runwal Developers Ltd., has been developing residential, commercial and retail real estate across Mumbai, Mumbai Metropolitan Region and Pune since 1978. Founded by Subhash Runwal and led today by Promoter & Managing Director Sandeep Runwal, the company has delivered 35 completed projects spanning 11.22 million square feet, building with precision and long-term value at every scale.\n\nRead More ↓)\n\nToday, Runwal Realty has 17  ongoing developments  across Mumbai, Thane and Pune. The residential portfolio spans ultra-luxury sky mansions at Malabar Hill, sea-view residences in Worli and Parel, township living in Thane, and a 26-acre mixed-use development in Chinchwad, Pune. [...] 48+\n\n35+\n\n22+\n\n## Our Real Estate Projects\n\n### Residential\n\nRunwal Realty offers luxury residences in Mumbai, combining timeless design, curated amenities, and serene landscapes to deliver a lifestyle of elegance, comfort, and seamless city access.\n\n[Read More](/our-project/residential/ongoing/)\n\n### Commercial\n\nRunwal Realty’s commercial spaces blend striking design and prime locations, offering modern businesses a prestigious address that inspires growth, productivity, and lasting professional impact.\n\n[Read More](/our-project/commercial/ongoing/)\n\n### Retail\n\nRunwal Realty redefines Mumbai retail with iconic destinations—curated spaces that blend luxury, experience, and opportunity for elite brands and discerning shoppers seeking more than just stores.","score":0.8557075331344176,"raw_content":null,"id":"54e78e-03"},{"url":"https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/runwal-group-projects-in-mumbai","title":"Runwal Group Properties in Mumbai - Keystone Real Estate Advisory","content":"Runwal Group builders developers offers 10+ lifestyle amenities, such as a gymnasium, indoor games, Reflexology, Sports Courts,","score":0.8178886073462849,"raw_content":null,"id":"9e08a9-04"},{"url":"https://runwalrealty.com/our-project/residential/ongoing","title":"Ongoing Residential Projects in Mumbai, Thane & Pune | Runwal Realty","content":"For a homebuyer, an ongoing project typically allows a wider choice of floor, view and configuration, sometimes with the option to customise certain interior elements. Payments are made in stages linked to construction progress. Floor plans, current pricing and site visits for any of the projects can be arranged through the Project Sales Enquiry team.\n\n\\Reflects residential projects currently shown on this page. Project counts disclosed in regulatory filings may include developments across other segments such as commercial, retail and hospitality.\n\nLast updated: 8th June 2026\n\nRead Less ↑)\n\nRunwal Group Transitions into Two Independent Groups —  \n Runwal Realty and Runwal Enterprises [...] Read More ↓)\n\nAccording to the company's Draft Red Herring Prospectus (DRHP) filed with SEBI in October 2025, Runwal Realty ranked among the top 10 developers in MMR by residential units supplied between January 2022 and March 2025, and was the second largest in Thane over the same period. Each of the ongoing projects is registered with the Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority, and the MahaRERA number and approved plans for each project are published on its respective page on this website, so buyers can verify the regulatory status with the authority directly before committing. [...] Runwal Realty under the leadership of Managing Director, Mr. Sandeep Runwal, is one of India’s leading luxury and lifestyle real estate developers, with over 35 delivered projects across key locations in the MMR and Pune regions. Beyond residential developments, the company has built a diversified platform spanning retail, commercial, and hospitality, including landmark assets such as R City Mall in Ghatkopar and R Square in Andheri. Its upcoming hospitality portfolio across Worli, Thane, Pune, and Alibaug further strengthens its mixed-use development expertise.","score":0.8092265697935822,"raw_content":null,"id":"960f5b-05"},{"url":"https://runwalrealty.com/contact-us","title":"Contact - Runwal Realty","content":"About Us +\n\n  Company Overview  Journey  CSR  Team\n Our Projects +\n\n  Residential  Commercial  Organized Retail\n NRI Corner\n Club Oasis\n Investors\n Customer Corner +\n\n  R Loyalist  The Specialists\n\n   Careers\n   Contact Us\n\n  Enquire Now\n\n  Runwal Realty logo\n\nProject Sales Enquiry 022-62328585 \n\n# Contact Us\n\n## Presence\n\n## Reach Us\n\n### Corporate Office Address\n\nRunwal & Omkar Esquare, 5th floor, off Eastern Express Highway, Opposite Sion Chunabhatti Signal, Sion (East), Mumbai - 400 022, Maharastra, India   \n Get Direction\n\n### Phone\n\nLandline - 022 - 61133000\n\nFax - 022 - 24093749\n\nProject Sales Enquiry -\n\n022-62328585\n\n### Email\n\ncorporate@runwal.com\n\n## Get In Touch\n\n## Enquire Now\n\n## Presence\n\n## Site Address\n\n### Runwal Raaya\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\nGet Direction\n\n### Runwal Lands End [...] Runwal Realty under the leadership of Managing Director, Mr. Sandeep Runwal, is one of India’s leading luxury and lifestyle real estate developers, with over 35 delivered projects across key locations in the MMR and Pune regions. Beyond residential developments, the company has built a diversified platform spanning retail, commercial, and hospitality, including landmark assets such as R City Mall in Ghatkopar and R Square in Andheri. Its upcoming hospitality portfolio across Worli, Thane, Pune, and Alibaug further strengthens its mixed-use development expertise.\n\n### What are the key residential projects by Runwal Realty?\n\n+ [...] Runwal Realty, led by Mr. Sandeep Runwal, has emerged as one of India's leading luxury and lifestyle real estate developers, with over 35 delivered projects across some of the MMR & Pune's most sought-after locations.\n\nBeyond residential developments, the company has built a diversified platform spanning retail, commercial, and hospitality, anchored by landmark assets such as R City Mall in Ghatkopar and R Square in Andheri.\n\nThe company's upcoming hospitality portfolio, comprising five hotels across Worli, Thane, Pune, and Alibaug, further deepens its mixed-use development expertise, which has long been central to its growth strategy.","score":0.7933136225385622,"raw_content":null,"id":"071374-06"},{"url":"https://runwal.co","title":"Runwal Enterprises | Best Real Estate Builders & Developers","content":"Q. Where are the new luxury developments located in Thane West?\n\nA:  Towers sit along prime transit corridors, situated close to elite neighborhoods like Panch Pakhadi.\n\nQ. What makes Kanjurmarg East a preferred destination for property buyers?\n\nA:  It offers seamless highway connectivity alongside premium integrated townships featuring world-class lifestyle amenities.\n\nView More\n\n× Enquire\n\nScroll to Top [...] Runwal Properties\n\n### Prime Location & Connectivity\n\nDevelopments are strategically mapped directly to Mumbai’s primary economic growth vectors. Choosing an address here places you moments away from major expressways, key metro links, and business hubs, keeping you connected to the heartbeat of the city while ensuring robust capital growth.\n\n## Our Landmark Projects - Building the Future\n\nThe residential and commercial developments across the MMR ecosystem redefine luxury, community living, and corporate efficiency through prime locations, robust engineering, and world-class integrated amenities.\n\nRunwal 7 Mahalaxmi\n\n#### Runwal 7 Mahalaxmi\n\nMeticulously crafted 2 & 3 BHK luxury flats\n\nMumbai\n\nRunwal Edge\n\n#### Runwal Edge\n\nHigh-yield commercial assets in the rapidly growing MMR region [...] Dombivli\n\nRunwal Kanjurmarg\n\n#### Runwal Kanjurmarg\n\nEnthralling 1 & 2 BHK Flats\n\nKanjurmarg East\n\nRunwal Forevergreen\n\n#### Runwal Forevergreen\n\nMeticulously crafted 2, 3 & 4 BHK flats\n\nKanjurmarg\n\nRunwal Park View\n\n#### Runwal Park View\n\nPristine Rich 1, 2 & 3 BHK Homes\n\nDombivli\n\nView More\n\n## Our Mission - Shaping a Better, Future-Ready Life","score":0.7799472833689316,"raw_content":null,"id":"d80b82-07"}],"response_time":3.75,"request_id":"1bc36168-ecd4-4dfb-aaa2-7d1ddecd9ac3"}